{"id": "27044", "title": "蒋光慈文集", "author": "蒋光慈", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/27/27044/27044s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/27/27044.htm", "intro": "蒋光慈（1901-1931），现代著名作家。二十年代前期曾留学苏联，1924年回国后，积极倡导革命文学，致力于普罗小说的创作。他是中国无产阶级文学运动中活跃人物之一，是具有代表性的革命小说作家。其小说多以大革命为背景，反映工农群众和青年知识分子的革命斗争。他经常采用“革命加恋爱”的主题，表现历史转变关头革命青年的苦闷、悲愤和奋起抗争的精神世界。", "base": "files/article/html/27/27044", "chapters": [{"title": "短篇", "volume": true}, {"title": "鸭绿江上", "file": "1833427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "弟兄夜话", "file": "1833430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "徐州旅馆之一夜", "file": "1833433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "寻爱", "file": "1833437.html", "available": false}, {"title": "少年飘泊者", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file": "9455572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "9455621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "9455698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "9455735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "9455771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "9455810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "野祭", "volume": true}, {"title": "书前", "file": "9456148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一", "file": "9456226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "9456247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "9456280.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "9456315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "9456336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "9456359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "9456389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "9456424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "9456488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "9456524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "丽莎的哀怨", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file": "9456608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "9456653.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", 